tenders.summary:
The Council requires an organisation to facilitate Community Events on the Ly² cultural events space in Crewe Town Centre and, potentially, other suitable Council-owned spaces in Crewe Town Centre.
The successful supplier shall: 
•	Facilitate and deliver Community Events in the event space known as Ly² and other suitable Council-owned spaces in Crewe Town Centre; 
•	Adhere to the Event Manager Liaison Process; 
•	Adhere to all relevant laws and guidance when delivering Community Events; 
•	Obtain all Necessary Consents for any Community Event; 
•	Ensure appropriate programming of the public screen; 
•	Provide practical support for accessing equipment for Community Events such as stage, power etc.
